{"id":"n16147-2-9","stage":2,"title":"모처럼 · 好久才","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n16147-2-9-1","ko":"모처럼 삼촌이 집에 왔으니 삼촌이랑 나가서 놀다가 오렴.","zh":"难得叔叔来家里了，你跟他出去玩一会儿再回来吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"모처럼","meaning":"好久才","explanation":"모처럼：好久才","readings":[{"term":"모처럼","audio":"/audio/c5e9364a3b55a5020afc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16147","senseId":"2","lemma":"모처럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모처럼","audio":"/audio/c5e9364a3b55a5020afc.mp3"}},{"text":"삼촌이","meaning":"叔叔，舅舅","explanation":"삼촌：叔叔，舅舅；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"삼촌","audio":"/audio/5d1a410b7ca871d4064c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61142","senseId":"1","lemma":"삼촌","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"삼촌이","audio":"/audio/2522f7b2d91efddf0083.mp3"}},{"text":"집에","meaning":"家","explanation":"집：家；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"3","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"집에","audio":"/audio/a007fc659cc1512ff2b3.mp3"}},{"text":"왔으니","meaning":"来","explanation":"오다：来；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；으니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"23","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왔으니","audio":"/audio/7e9c53b31fcc4a606e45.mp3"}},{"text":"삼촌이랑","meaning":"叔叔，舅舅","explanation":"삼촌：叔叔，舅舅；이랑：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"삼촌","audio":"/audio/5d1a410b7ca871d4064c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61142","senseId":"1","lemma":"삼촌","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"삼촌이랑","audio":"/audio/a371cd8cc3e24a347419.mp3"}},{"text":"나가서","meaning":"去","explanation":"나가다：去；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"나가다","audio":"/audio/961ee88770fe6ab5a409.mp3"}],"sources"